<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-6577] During start cache we should check temporary file existence besides lock file</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6577</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Now we discard content of cache directory if there is lock file because it means that cache was not completely restored.&lt;br/&gt;
But except it, there could be temporary directory and if there is marker file it means that cache restore wasn&apos;t completed. &lt;/p&gt;</description>
